70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, I respect your caution, but safety cannot wait for perfect weather. Option D is the only choice that honors our shared commitment to human well-being.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
